{
 "voice": "am_michael",
 "speed": 0.94,
 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "n01",
   "text": "Nobody knew what would happen next. Behind closed doors, the world's leaders had already decided."
  },
  {
   "id": "o01",
   "voice": "am_onyx",
   "speed": 0.95,
   "text": "Effective immediately, all childbirth is prohibited. Every pregnancy must be registered. Violators will be imprisoned."
  },
  {
   "id": "n02",
   "text": "Stop new births, and the population would stabilize. Or so they believed."
  },
  {
   "id": "n03",
   "text": "But the law couldn't undo the damage. Billions still needed food, water, power, and a place to live."
  },
  {
   "id": "p01",
   "voice": "af_bella",
   "speed": 1.05,
   "text": "We stopped aging! We didn't agree to stop living!"
  },
  {
   "id": "n04",
   "text": "People had wanted eternal life. Now they were fighting for the right to have a future."
  },
  {
   "id": "n05",
   "text": "While the world blamed overpopulation, scientists found another problem. The human body was still vulnerable."
  },
  {
   "id": "s01",
   "voice": "bm_george",
   "speed": 0.9,
   "text": "Impossible... We've stopped aging, but we haven't stopped the damage."
  },
  {
   "id": "d01",
   "voice": "am_eric",
   "speed": 0.95,
   "text": "His body never aged... but the disease destroyed his organs."
  },
  {
   "id": "n06",
   "speed": 0.88,
   "text": "Immortality had never meant invincibility."
  },
  {
   "id": "s02",
   "voice": "bm_george",
   "speed": 0.85,
   "fx": "whisper",
   "mix": 0.5,
   "text": "No... They can't actually do this."
  },
  {
   "id": "n07",
   "speed": 0.92,
   "text": "But the most terrifying discovery wasn't that the government had a plan..."
  }
 ],
